{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 20, "model_name": "mistralai/mistral-small-4-119b-2603", "content": "Hark! Pray lend thine ear to this most wondrous journey through the fair land of Japan. Behold thy itinerary writ in the tongue of the immortal Bard.\n\n**Day One**\n*In the Land of the Rising Sun’s fair capital*\nUpon thy arrival in Tokyo’s realm thou shalt be met by spirits of modernity and tradition. First visit the grand shrine of Meiji where ancient gods do dwell. Then to Shibuya’s throng where lights do dance like fireflies in the night. Supper at a ramen house where the broth is as rich as Portia’s wit.\n\n**Day Two**\n*In the Garden of Edo’s Past*\nTo the east thou shalt journey to Asakusa’s temple fair where incense doth rise like prayers to heaven. Then to Ueno’s park where cherry blossoms do blush like the cheeks of maidens. Feast upon tempura so light it seemeth to float upon the air.\n\n**Day Three**\n*In the Realm of the Samurai’s Ghosts*\nTo Kamakura’s shore where the great Buddha doth sit in silent judgment. Walk the paths of the samurai where swords once clashed like thunder. Dine where the geisha once trod and the lanterns do glow like stars fallen to earth.\n\n**Day Four**\n*In the Cloud’s Abode*\nTo Hakone’s mountains where the mists do weave like fairies’ veils. Ride a ship upon the lake where Mount Fuji doth stand like a king upon his throne. Rest in a ryokan where the tatami is soft as a lover’s sigh.\n\n**Day Five**\n*In the Land of the Rising Moon*\nTo Kyoto’s ancient streets where the past doth whisper in every stone. Visit the golden pavilion where the sun’s rays do kiss the earth. Witness a tea ceremony where the matcha is as green as spring’s first leaf. Supper where the kaiseki feast doth unfold like a scroll of beauty.\n\n**Day Six**\n*In the Vale of Nara’s Deer*\nTo Nara where the sacred deer do bow as courtiers to a queen. Stand before the colossal Buddha where man and god do meet. Wander the gardens where the koi do leap as if to escape the cares of the world.\n\n**Day Seven**\n*In the City of the Future*\nReturn to Tokyo where the future doth gleam like a knight’s polished armor. Visit Akihabara’s wonders where robots and dreams do intertwine. Take thy leave with memories sweet as the sakura’s scent. Fare thee well till next we meet in some far-off land.", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -1.8901259899139404}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -0.00019095504831057042}, {"token": "!", "logprob": -0.27951422333717346}, {"token": " P", "logprob": -0.5144657492637634}, {"token": "ray", "logprob": -0.0008370947907678783}, {"token": " lend", "logprob": -1.0840559005737305}, {"token": " th", "logprob": -0.0004111875023227185}, {"token": "ine", "logprob": -2.50339189733495e-06}, {"token": " ear", "logprob": -0.20153018832206726}, {"token": " to", "logprob": -0.11028923839330673}, {"token": " this", "logprob": -0.0634877160191536}, {"token": " most", "logprob": -0.3481561839580536}, {"token": " w", "logprob": -0.3293152153491974}, {"token": "ond", "logprob": -5.8412379075889476e-06}, {"token": "rous", "logprob": -5.960462772236497e-07}, {"token": " journey", "logprob": -1.370530366897583}, {"token": " through", "logprob": -0.46889400482177734}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.07779696583747864}, {"token": " fair", "logprob": -0.43611961603164673}, {"token": " land", "logprob": -1.8209762573242188}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -0.00020394629973452538}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -1.8077058792114258}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -1.1783162355422974}, {"token": " Be", "logprob": -3.0742292404174805}, {"token": "hold", "logprob": -0.001405204995535314}, {"token": " thy", "logprob": -0.6061416864395142}, {"token": " itiner", "logprob": -0.0032782405614852905}, {"token": "ary", "logprob": -0.007137988694012165}, {"token": " writ", "logprob": -0.3588714599609375}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.0056432695128023624}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.17082075774669647}, {"token": " ton